&lt;li&gt;Review workflow process and leverage AI tools to find ways to improve productivity, eliminate repetitive tasks, reduce errors and increase the quality of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the project management process: assigning projects, collecting relevant details, unblocking dependencies, providing feedback, and looping in stakeholders in a timely manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the UA creative budget, tracking vendor output and proactively source, evaluate and onboard new vendors as needed, ensuring they meet quality standards and strategic goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze campaign performance data to isolate creative variables, create reports to share and use these insights to guide future winning creative strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Performance Marketing team to ensure creative strategies align with broader user acquisition goals, contributing regularly to weekly meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assign gameplay screen recordings to capture artists, troubleshoot and unblock issues by working closely with cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform quality control on design deliverables, ensuring accuracy for sizing and localization requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Required 3 in-office days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in a creative production or creative development role, ideally in the mobile gaming or digital advertising industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent experience in Marketing, Advertising, Graphic Design, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use AI tools to solve workflow bottlenecks and increase output efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of user acquisition strategies and how creative assets drive performance in mobile gaming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing complex projects from conception to completion while optimizing workflow processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with high-profile third-party IP and navigating strict brand standards and approval processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Adobe Creative Suite and proficiency in project management software (JIRA, Asana, Wrike)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced hybrid environment and handle stress appropriately and/or ability to solve practical problems and be sufficiently adaptable to handle dynamic situations with little advance notice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on cross-functional teams with ability to communicate effectively through written and verbal communications, including synchronous interactions with others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus if you have a strong familiarity and knowledge of the Pokémon and Pokémon GO brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
