&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot;&gt;The Electronics Design Engineer will be a member of the hardware team delivering low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot;&gt;‑&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot;&gt;noise, high&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot;&gt;‑&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot;&gt;frequency mixed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot;&gt;‑&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot;&gt;signal&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot;&gt;control&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and instrumentation for our QKD systems. The role spans end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot;&gt;‑&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot;&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot;&gt;‑&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot;&gt;end board design in Altium (schematics, layout, DFM/DFT), precision analog signal chains, prototype bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot;&gt;‑&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot;&gt;up/validation, and, where needed, STM32 (F4/H7) firmware in C for control, calibration, and integration. You will work with existing automated measurement software in Python and extend it where needed, collaborate closely with optics, FPGA, and software, and support manufacturing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW226927026 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
