&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Owning hardware architecture and&amp;nbsp;component&amp;nbsp;selection for precision,&amp;nbsp;lownoise, and&amp;nbsp;highfrequency&amp;nbsp;performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Designing&amp;nbsp;lownoise&amp;nbsp;analog and&amp;nbsp;mixedsignal&amp;nbsp;schematics and PCB layout in Altium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Managing prototype builds and vendors; executing&amp;nbsp;bringup; precision and&amp;nbsp;highfrequency&amp;nbsp;measurements (DC accuracy, noise spectral density,&amp;nbsp;longterm&amp;nbsp;drift, frequency response); lab debug and reworks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Working with existing automated measurement software (Python) and extending it where needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
